@startuml
title UML sequence behaviour — Clear completed with no completed tasks
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
actor "User" as user
box "Frontend — Angular SPA (UI components)" #E0F2FE
  participant "TodoPageComponent" as page
end box
box "Frontend — Angular SPA (state and API client)" #E0F2FE
  participant "TodoStore" as store
end box
store -> store : completedCount computed from the todos signal is 0
store --> page : completedCount is 0
page --> user : "Clear completed" button disabled with aria-disabled="true" (L2-017)
user -> page : Click or press the disabled button
page --> user : Nothing happens, no event and no request (L2-017)
note over page, store : Button becomes enabled when completedCount rises above 0, and disabled again after a clear
@enduml
